<title>CANADA: Canada to hold 6 bond auctions in Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Canada to hold 6 bond auctions in Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada said it will hold six bond auctions, including one real return issue, in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The first auction, of three-year bonds, will be on January 8, with details to be released on January 3.</p>
<p>Further details follow.</p>
</text>
